# Two-system mining loop for prophet-2. Overrides data/scripts/idle_mine.smolt
# (data/agents/<id>/scripts wins in ScriptSearchPaths).
#
# Why not just mine at home: ironhearth is picked over for ore, and this agent was
# logging "Resources depleted" every other pass. 82_eridani has NO STATION, which is
# exactly why its rock is untouched — 110,300 remaining at richness 52, single belt so $ASTEROID_BELT$ cannot pick wrong. Nobody mines where they cannot dock.
#
# Home stays ironhearth because its fuel desk is MEASURED (station_fuel_prices).
# The nearer low-security systems with their own station — alzirr, gsc_0034,
# tiaki, silvermark — have never had a fuel reading, and an unverified desk in
# lawless space is how an agent strands.
#
# refuel is LAST so the tank is full before the next pass's outbound jump.
# loop -f tolerates "Resources depleted" and exits early on cargo_full, which
# the server reports as a GoalReachedError.
#
# get_system after EVERY jump is load-bearing, not decoration. $ASTEROID_BELT$
# and $STATION$ resolve against the client's cached POI list, which still holds
# the PREVIOUS system's POIs immediately after a jump. Without the refresh,
# miner-10 jumped to frostfeld and then tried to travel to "Ironhearth Fields",
# the belt it had just left, and the pass died there (observed 2026-08-21).
# get_system is an info query: no tick cost.
jump 82_eridani
get_system
travel $ASTEROID_BELT$
loop -f 100 mine
jump ironhearth
get_system
travel $STATION$
dock
deposit_all
refuel
